SUMMARY:FreeOnFriday? Mt Vernon 21R
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRIDE LEADER: Jan Zerfoss\
 , average pace 12-13 mph.\nCue and Ride with GPS link: [Mt Vernon](https:/
 /ridewithgps.com/routes/49062802)\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Togethe
 r**\n\nThis is a casual ride and the ride leader will ride at the advertis
 ed pace. Some riders may ride faster than the leader so we'll likely break
  into one or more smaller groups. We will stop to regroup periodically. Pl
 ease stay with other riders in your pace group so everyone has someone to 
 ride with and nobody is riding solo. Usually no designated sweep but nobod
 y will get dropped.\n\nSalisbury Township Community Park has well maintain
 ed restrooms that are usually open.\n\nPost-ride coffee/refreshments - Sta
 rbuck's 5360 Lincoln Highway Gap PA. Just about .25 mile from the start lo
 cation. There is indoor and outdoor seating.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No 
 earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire leve
 rs\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper wa
 iver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this r
 ide. Being on\nMeetup does not mean you are a club member. Join here [Memb
 er Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_
 id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of C
 onduct: [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?p
 age_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\nGuidance if an incident occu
 rs: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=
 22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
