SUMMARY:Cape May Ferry/Zoo Weekend RSVP required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**One of our favorite wee
 kends! Join your friends from the Lancaster Bicycle Club and Wilmington Cl
 ub for a ride on the Cape May Ferry and bike ride to the Cape May Zoo a we
 ek end at Rehoboth Beach\, Delaware.**\n**Friday\, May 22-Sunday\, May 24t
 h**\n**Schedule:**\n**-check in the motel 3pm\, so be dressed and ready to
  ride at 3pm**\n**riding down the coastal highway to Indian River Outlet\,
  24 mile ride round trip….easy flat ride along the ocean and shoreline.*
 * **At 7pm we will meet together\, suggest place for supper.**\n**Saturday
  morning finish breakfast 7am\, on our bike 7:15 am to ride to the Lewes-C
 ape May Ferry for the 8:45am ride. Cost with our bicycles $16 round trip C
 all to make your reservation and make sure you tell them bicycle\, not aut
 omobile… 800-643-3779.**\n**Arrive in Cape May off the Ferry and on to t
 he paved 15 mile Middle Creek Bike Trail to the Cape May Zoo. Admission to
  the zoo is free. It is a surprisingly\, wonderful zoo! After the zoo\, we
  will take either the 4:30 Ferry or 6pm Ferry back to Lewes.**\n**-Sunday 
 morning check out motel but dressed\, ready to ride. 9am riding the 4 trai
 ls\, loop from Lewis\, Gordon’s Pond\, Cape Henlopen\, Rehoboth\, trail 
 ride 24 miles. Trail paved\, crushed gravel\, hard dirt through the woods.
  Finish the ride and leave for home.**\n**Sleep Inn Rehoboth\,** **18451 C
 ostal Highway 302-200-6930.**\n**We have stayed here many times before\, w
 onderful breakfast included…Call to make your reservation at 302-200-693
 0. Or click link:**\n[Rates & Available Rooms - Sleep Inn & Suites Rehobot
 h Beach](https://www.choicehotels.com/reservations/groups/tk58q0?checkInDa
 te=2026-05-22&checkOutDate=2026-05-24&ratePlanCode=BZFKGY)\n**Make sure to
  tell them “Lancaster Bike Club” for our special rate. We have reserve
 d 10 rooms/suites that can sleep 4 to 6 persons at $180 a night per room\,
  two double beds. Special price for these rooms is held until April 22.**\
 n**Richard Conner 717-572-8480**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3140389
 13/
